  "controls": "One ELF contains baseline and candidate. Each case runs four balanced pairs (B/C,C/B,B/C,C/B) on a shared verified fixture. /proc/self/stat user+system CPU at 100 ticks/s; tick reads outside wall timer. Fresh entry construction per iteration. Do not pool timings across boots, serializer versions, or isolated-process and shared-process harnesses.",
